                            <comment id="16506899" author="dpavlov" created="Sat, 9 Jun 2018 10:30:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sharpler&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sharpler&quot;&gt;sharpler&lt;/a&gt; thank you for contribution. Each step like this make us closer to green TC day.&lt;/p&gt;

